<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98054" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύ-ζευξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a being yoked together</i>, esp. of <i>wedded union</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				930b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1253b10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1335a10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>close union, combination</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				508a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				73
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς ς. τῆς τούτων
			ἀριθμός</span> the number of their <i>combinations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1290b32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσαῦτ᾽ εἴδη . . ὅσαιπερ αἱ ς.
				τῶν μορίων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μέχρι πλείονος τῶν ἄρθρων
			ς</span>. the <i>confinement</i> of the joints in swaddling
			clothes, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.84
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ σύζευξιν</span>, of an army marching
				<i>in parallel columns</i>, Ascl.Tact.<i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
